            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1007-f3" n="54" xml:id="d1007-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 264, March 17, 11 a.m., from Panama, reported that Duncan had returned
                    to Panama (819.00/3–1745).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
